      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span><span><span>The sale enabled the Company to concentrate on its international pharmaceutical distribution business. The sale was part of several strategic changes to become a digital assets treasury company.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
