  <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20260727103613494" name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetTextBlock" contextRef="C_20260101to20260630" escape="true">
    <div>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span><span><span><strong>7.</strong>&#160;<strong>DIGITAL ASSETS </strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span><span><span>On March 31, 2026, the Company entered into a note settlement agreement (the "Note Settlement Agreement") with Zero Gravity Labs Inc. ("Zero Gravity") pursuant to which the Zero Gravity Convertible Note (as defined below) was settled. As part of the settlement, the Company transferred <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20251030184158294" name="zstk:NumberOfCryptoAssetsUnitsTransferred" contextRef="C_20260101to20260331_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkZeroGravityConvertibleNoteMember" unitRef="Token" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">50,000,000</ix:nonFraction> 0G tokens to Zero Gravity to satisfy all outstanding principal and interest associated with the Zero Gravity Convertible Note. See Note 9.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span><span><span>The Company began staking its 0G tokens on January 21, 2026 with third-party validators. For the three months ended June 30, 2026, the Company earned total rewards of <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260427130652810" name="zstk:DigitalAssetStakingRewardsEarnedNumberOfUnits" contextRef="C_20260401to20260630_srtCryptoAssetAxis_zstkThirdPartyValidatorMember_usgaapFinancialInstrumentAxis_zstkDigitalAssetsMember" unitRef="Token" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2,254,442</ix:nonFraction> 0G tokens, or $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260429172606618" name="zstk:DigitalAssetRevenues" contextRef="C_20260401to20260630_srtCryptoAssetAxis_zstkThirdPartyValidatorMember_usgaapFinancialInstrumentAxis_zstkDigitalAssetsMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.0</ix:nonFraction> million, net of a <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260427131100954" name="zstk:PercentageOfCryptoAssetCommissionPaid" contextRef="C_20260401to20260630_srtCryptoAssetAxis_zstkThirdPartyValidatorMember_usgaapFinancialInstrumentAxis_zstkDigitalAssetsMember" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1</ix:nonFraction>% commission paid to the validators (2025 - <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260427131115936" name="zstk:PercentageOfCryptoAssetCommissionPaid" contextRef="C_20250401to20250630_srtCryptoAssetAxis_zstkThirdPartyValidatorMember_usgaapFinancialInstrumentAxis_zstkDigitalAssetsMember" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">nil</ix:nonFraction>). For the six months ended June 30, 2026, the Company earned total rewards of <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260727110935899" name="zstk:DigitalAssetStakingRewardsEarnedNumberOfUnits" contextRef="C_20260101to20260630_srtCryptoAssetAxis_zstkThirdPartyValidatorMember_usgaapFinancialInstrumentAxis_zstkDigitalAssetsMember" unitRef="Token" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">6,619,166</ix:nonFraction> 0G tokens, or $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260727143846435" name="zstk:DigitalAssetRevenues" contextRef="C_20260101to20260630_srtCryptoAssetAxis_zstkThirdPartyValidatorMember_usgaapFinancialInstrumentAxis_zstkDigitalAssetsMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3.8</ix:nonFraction> million, net of a <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260727111047399" name="zstk:PercentageOfCryptoAssetCommissionPaid" contextRef="C_20260101to20260630_srtCryptoAssetAxis_zstkThirdPartyValidatorMember_srtRangeAxis_srtMinimumMember_usgaapFinancialInstrumentAxis_zstkDigitalAssetsMember" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1</ix:nonFraction>% or <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260727112934464" name="zstk:PercentageOfCryptoAssetCommissionPaid" contextRef="C_20260101to20260630_srtCryptoAssetAxis_zstkThirdPartyValidatorMember_srtRangeAxis_srtMaximumMember_usgaapFinancialInstrumentAxis_zstkDigitalAssetsMember" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2</ix:nonFraction>% commission paid to the validators (2025 - <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260727111106324" name="zstk:PercentageOfCryptoAssetCommissionPaid" contextRef="C_20250101to20250630_srtCryptoAssetAxis_zstkThirdPartyValidatorMember_usgaapFinancialInstrumentAxis_zstkDigitalAssetsMember" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">nil</ix:nonFraction>). See Note 17. The Company classifies proceeds from the sale of 0G tokens received as staking rewards as operating cash flows, as these tokens represent yield on the Company's core digital asset holdings and are recognized as revenue when earned. The Company maintains staking rewards separately and intends to use them principally to fund operating expenses.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span><span><span>In April 2026, the Company transferred <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260727112124963" name="zstk:NumberOfCryptoAssetsUnitsTransferred" contextRef="C_20260430to20260430" unitRef="Token" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">10,000,004</ix:nonFraction> 0G tokens into a separate wallet. The Company intends to sell these 0G tokens to fund operating expenses. The Company&#8217;s treasury strategy is to replenish operating liquidity with staking rewards as they are earned. During the three and six months ended June 30, 2026, <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260727142613229" name="zstk:NumberOfCryptoAssetsUnitsSold" contextRef="C_20260101to20260630" unitRef="Token" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260727113506703" name="zstk:NumberOfCryptoAssetsUnitsSold" contextRef="C_20260401to20260630" unitRef="Token" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">4,935,827</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> of these 0G tokens were sold for $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260727113738583" name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetSale" contextRef="C_20260101to20260630" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260727113608581" name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetSale" contextRef="C_20260401to20260630" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2.4</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> million.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span><span><span>As of June 30, 2026, the Company's digital assets consist of the following:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
