  <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20260727115433821" name="zstk:WarrantsDisclosureTextBlock" contextRef="C_20260101to20260630" escape="true">
    <div>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><strong>13.</strong>&#160;<strong>WARRANTS</strong></span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><strong>2025 PRIVATE PLACEMENT</strong></span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">As discussed in the 2025 Annual Report, the Company issued an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20251030184716823" name="zstk:NumberOfWarrantsIssuedDuringPeriod" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3,004,249</ix:nonFraction> pre-funded warrants to purchase one Common Share at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20251030184901887" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20250926_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.0001</ix:nonFraction> ("PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants") and <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20251030184746910" name="zstk:NumberOfWarrantsIssuedDuringPeriod" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">105,666</ix:nonFraction> Common Share purchase warrants to purchase one Common Share at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20251030185020686" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">25.19</ix:nonFraction> ("PIPE Warrants") on September 26, 2025, in connection with the first closing of a private placement offering ("PIPE Offering"). The Company issued another <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260427142700192" name="zstk:NumberOfWarrantsIssuedDuringPeriod" contextRef="C_20251009to20251009_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkSecondClosingMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5,962,681</ix:nonFraction> PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants and <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260427142743319" name="zstk:NumberOfWarrantsIssuedDuringPeriod" contextRef="C_20251009to20251009_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkSecondClosingMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1,586</ix:nonFraction> PIPE Warrants on October 9, 2025, in connection with the second closing of the PIPE Offering. Subject to shareholder approval, which occurred on December 19, 2025, each PIPE Pre-Funded Warrant entitles the holder to purchase one Common Share at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260427142802431" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20251219_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.0001</ix:nonFraction>, and each PIPE Warrant entitles the holder to purchase one Common Share at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260427142810030" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20251219_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">25.19</ix:nonFraction>. The PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants have no expiry date, whereas the PIPE Warrants expire <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20251101003301788" name="zstk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerms" contextRef="C_20251219to20251219_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember">1,825 days</ix:nonNumeric> after shareholder approval.</span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">The PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants and the PIPE Warrants are classified as equity because they are freestanding financial instruments, are immediately exercisable, permit the holder to receive a fixed number of the Common Shares and do not provide any guarantee of value or return.</span></span></p>
