    <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">The $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260427120607017" name="us-gaap:ConvertibleDebtFairValueDisclosures" contextRef="C_20251231_usgaapFairValueByFairValueHierarchyLevelAxis_usgaapFairValueInputsLevel3Member" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">50.7</ix:nonFraction> million change in the Level 3 convertible notes payable was due to the settlement of the Zero Gravity Convertible Note which was valued at $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260427120633882" name="us-gaap:ConvertibleDebtFairValueDisclosures" contextRef="C_20251231_usgaapDebtInstrumentAxis_zstkZeroGravityConvertibleNoteMember_usgaapFairValueByFairValueHierarchyLevelAxis_usgaapFairValueInputsLevel3Member" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">27.7</ix:nonFraction> million on the date of settlement. The remaining $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260427120648185" name="zstk:FairValueConvertibleNotesPayableChangesInFairValueGainLoss" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231_usgaapDebtInstrumentAxis_zstkZeroGravityConvertibleNoteMember_usgaapFairValueByFairValueHierarchyLevelAxis_usgaapFairValueInputsLevel3Member" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">23.0</ix:nonFraction> million was recorded as a gain in the changes in financial instruments fair value on the unaudited condensed interim consolidated statements of loss and comprehensive loss.</span></span></p>
