      <p style="margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">There were <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260727113742870" name="zstk:PipePreFundedWarrantsExercisedDuringPeriod" contextRef="C_20260701to20260731_usgaapSubsequentEventTypeAxis_usgaapSubsequentEventMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5,954,743</ix:nonFraction> PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants exercised subsequent to June 30, 2026.</span></span></p>
